(4651180, 671186, 79955, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract feel to it, I''m sure some would say not enough in focus. I also wish you could have gotten more of the droplet to be sharper , but I like it 6</td>', 'Nice abstract feel to it, I''m sure some would say not enough in focus. I also wish you could have gotten more of the droplet to be sharper , but I like it 6', '2008-04-21 09:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
