(4651612, 671273, 83328, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and background, i love the fineness and detail. My only comment is that the bottom of the feather is too OOF.</td>', 'nice lighting and background, i love the fineness and detail. My only comment is that the bottom of the feather is too OOF.', '2008-04-21 13:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4651620, 671409, 83328, '<td valign="top">nice execution, my only comment is that the image is a bit busy. My eye was first drawn to the brown part in teh center of the frame, then to the thing coming out to the bottom right from it, then to the reflection in that water. After a couple second I found the other droplet to the left and the tomato inside. A tighter crop would have helped</td>', 'nice execution, my only comment is that the image is a bit busy. My eye was first drawn to the brown part in teh center of the frame, then to the thing coming out to the bottom right from it, then to the reflection in that water. After a couple second I found the other droplet to the left and the tomato inside. A tighter crop would have helped', '2008-04-21 13:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4651653, 671178, 73981, '<td valign="top">might have made a better shot had they been cooked first. Cooked always seems to look nicer and make people hungry!</td>', 'might have made a better shot had they been cooked first. Cooked always seems to look nicer and make people hungry!', '2008-04-21 13:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4651656, 670740, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like the shot. The idea, the lighting and composition. Only nitpick, the nut inside the shell is lopsided. Having a straight on symmetric, I would''ve scored higher.</td>', 'Really like the shot. The idea, the lighting and composition. Only nitpick, the nut inside the shell is lopsided. Having a straight on symmetric, I would''ve scored higher.', '2008-04-21 13:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
