(4651837, 671225, 83328, '<td valign="top">This is very interesting to me. I like the tones of the grays and how it almost looks like a painting. Makes me think of Mark Rothko in a (circular) way. This is probably not going to score very high at DPC, but i like it quite a bit. Good job on the choice of subject</td>', 'This is very interesting to me. I like the tones of the grays and how it almost looks like a painting. Makes me think of Mark Rothko in a (circular) way. This is probably not going to score very high at DPC, but i like it quite a bit. Good job on the choice of subject', '2008-04-21 16:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4651847, 671183, 83328, '<td valign="top">great sharpness and tones, i like how you tilted the camera (or rotated the image in post)</td>', 'great sharpness and tones, i like how you tilted the camera (or rotated the image in post)', '2008-04-21 16:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4651852, 671260, 83328, '<td valign="top">nice arrangement, i like the setup. I would have sharpened a little more though</td>', 'nice arrangement, i like the setup. I would have sharpened a little more though', '2008-04-21 16:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4651857, 671475, 83328, '<td valign="top">Great image, i wish i can shoot something like this sometime. Very striking, my only comment is that the area in best focus seems to be the feathers between the eyes instead of the eyes. I know DOF is shallow and getting the bird to look straight at you is probably really hard, so good job on this one</td>', 'Great image, i wish i can shoot something like this sometime. Very striking, my only comment is that the area in best focus seems to be the feathers between the eyes instead of the eyes. I know DOF is shallow and getting the bird to look straight at you is probably really hard, so good job on this one', '2008-04-21 16:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4651860, 670712, 88136, '<td valign="top">my brain keeps telling me to reach out and wipe the water off the glass. its as if i can touch the watch if i want</td>', 'my brain keeps telling me to reach out and wipe the water off the glass. its as if i can touch the watch if i want', '2008-04-21 16:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
