(4652647, 671436, 15407, '<td valign="top">This for me is one of the best photos in the challenge &amp; I wasn''t even sure what they were.  I like the composure, colors textures and the way they work in harmony to guide your eye around in the photo. I also was taken by the frame and how the subjects seem to fade into the frame on bottom. The 3D effect of the frame is interesting although it makes me wonder if the frame should be flipped horizontally as the light source seems to be coming from the left of the subject. ~ 8</td>', 'This for me is one of the best photos in the challenge & I wasn''t even sure what they were.  I like the composure, colors textures and the way they work in harmony to guide your eye around in the photo. I also was taken by the frame and how the subjects seem to fade into the frame on bottom. The 3D effect of the frame is interesting although it makes me wonder if the frame should be flipped horizontally as the light source seems to be coming from the left of the subject. ~ 8', '2008-04-22 02:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
