(4653486, 671431, 77192, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit of a yellow cast on the picture. The bird isn''t at all in focus or looking at the camera. I can''t really honestly call it a macro shot. you''ve also some slight fringes around the back of the bird and on the wire - possibly caused by the lens.<br/> <br/>Sorry to seem overly critical.</td>', 'There''s a bit of a yellow cast on the picture. The bird isn''t at all in focus or looking at the camera. I can''t really honestly call it a macro shot. you''ve also some slight fringes around the back of the bird and on the wire - possibly caused by the lens. Sorry to seem overly critical.', '2008-04-22 15:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4653489, 671429, 77192, '<td valign="top">I like the bright colour of the face and the general composition. It''s not very sharp though. I''m guessing you''ve taken a small part of the picture and cropped it at almost actual size, consequently you''ve got a not ver sharp picture.</td>', 'I like the bright colour of the face and the general composition. It''s not very sharp though. I''m guessing you''ve taken a small part of the picture and cropped it at almost actual size, consequently you''ve got a not ver sharp picture.', '2008-04-22 15:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
