(4659671, 671468, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think I would have apllied some contrast or maybe darkened the photo to bring the leaves out more.</td>', 'I think I would have apllied some contrast or maybe darkened the photo to bring the leaves out more.', '2008-04-25 20:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
