(4661040, 670098, 83313, '<td valign="top">This almost works for me, but it''s not quite a killer shot. Not totally sure why. I like your shading in the background, but the clarity of the actual subject is still not spot on. It''s hard to get a deep DOF at such range, and I think this one begs for more DOF and to be a little brighter.</td>', 'This almost works for me, but it''s not quite a killer shot. Not totally sure why. I like your shading in the background, but the clarity of the actual subject is still not spot on. It''s hard to get a deep DOF at such range, and I think this one begs for more DOF and to be a little brighter.', '2008-04-27 13:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661094, 671340, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bold colors and nice sharp details. Curious what this is a detail view of.</td>', 'Bold colors and nice sharp details. Curious what this is a detail view of.', '2008-04-27 13:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661096, 671292, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on this. It''s not wowing me any, however. Perhaps a little static, or the shallow DOF is not working on this one.</td>', 'I like the lighting on this. It''s not wowing me any, however. Perhaps a little static, or the shallow DOF is not working on this one.', '2008-04-27 13:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4661103, 669557, 83313, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of potential here and you did nicely in some regards, unfortunately, it''s got some major problems holding it down. Seems quite grainy and not sharp in any area of the image. I think the lighting is just right to show off the stone and the details of the ring. Composition is pretty good as well, leading the eye a little off center to the stone. If the other elements were there, this would have a fair amount of visual pop to it.</td>', 'There''s a lot of potential here and you did nicely in some regards, unfortunately, it''s got some major problems holding it down. Seems quite grainy and not sharp in any area of the image. I think the lighting is just right to show off the stone and the details of the ring. Composition is pretty good as well, leading the eye a little off center to the stone. If the other elements were there, this would have a fair amount of visual pop to it.', '2008-04-27 13:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
