(4662758, 670946, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is outstanding, Shez - it looks like a painting. The metal tones come out beautifully. <br/> <br/>Of course this is a macro. I think the commenter below may not know what a fob watch is and thought it was a big clock. <br/> <br/>Anyway - I think this should have rated higher.</td>', 'This is outstanding, Shez - it looks like a painting. The metal tones come out beautifully.  Of course this is a macro. I think the commenter below may not know what a fob watch is and thought it was a big clock.  Anyway - I think this should have rated higher.', '2008-04-28 11:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4662801, 671455, 7778, '<td valign="top">and it''s composed by weight (dark vs. light), which, I imagine,<br/>is not an <i>obvious</i> option given that the points of interest<br/>are left quite literally<br/> <br/>along the margins.<br/> <br/></td>', 'and it''s composed by weight (dark vs. light), which, I imagine,is not an obvious option given that the points of interestare left quite literally along the margins. ', '2008-04-28 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(4662820, 671264, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice. It makes my eyes water. ;) Very clever to think of using such an everyday item to make an interesting and artistic image.</td>', 'Very nice. It makes my eyes water. ;) Very clever to think of using such an everyday item to make an interesting and artistic image.', '2008-04-28 12:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4662824, 671308, 66384, '<td valign="top">Cool textures and light. I especially like the color. What is it?</td>', 'Cool textures and light. I especially like the color. What is it?', '2008-04-28 12:35:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4662834, 670762, 66384, '<td valign="top">How very interesting to have a collection of old razor blades. I remember when medicine cabinets had a slot in the back to dump the old blades into the wall cavity (or wherever they went). I like the random scattering of the blades, and the light showing the metallic texture so well. Really nice clear macro.</td>', 'How very interesting to have a collection of old razor blades. I remember when medicine cabinets had a slot in the back to dump the old blades into the wall cavity (or wherever they went). I like the random scattering of the blades, and the light showing the metallic texture so well. Really nice clear macro.', '2008-04-28 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4662835, 670946, 62357, '<td valign="top">Shez, very surprised this didn''t score higher. Nice choice of subject.</td>', 'Shez, very surprised this didn''t score higher. Nice choice of subject.', '2008-04-28 12:42:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4662850, 671354, 63269, '<td valign="top">I fully agree with the comments below - and look at the commenters average. A solid 8. Probably what I would have given it too, had I voted. ;) Without question this deserved a much better score. Terrific image!</td>', 'I fully agree with the comments below - and look at the commenters average. A solid 8. Probably what I would have given it too, had I voted. ;) Without question this deserved a much better score. Terrific image!', '2008-04-28 12:50:35.000000', NULL, 0),
