(4663293, 670740, 68514, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hotpasta:</b></div><hr/><i> I love this Paolo...eccelente fratello!<br/> <br/>Simple and effective...<br/> <br/>I suppose good things really do come from the north of Italy! La mia familglia e Calabrese!<br/> <br/>Well done and congratulations on a good finish </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Not everything Enzo, many good things come from south too :)<br/>Italy is a lovely but strange country anyway... ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by hotpasta: I love this Paolo...eccelente fratello! Simple and effective... I suppose good things really do come from the north of Italy! La mia familglia e Calabrese! Well done and congratulations on a good finish  Not everything Enzo, many good things come from south too :)Italy is a lovely but strange country anyway... ;)', '2008-04-28 16:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
