(4676568, 671202, 87278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Citadel:</b></div><hr/><i> In retrospect, something in the back of my mind told me that this was yours Irene. I don''t know anyone who has such skill in photographing liquids. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I too had the same feeling and sent a PM to Irene last week feeling a bit embarrassed about it since I am no photographer and so whether my instincts will be valued!<br/> <br/>Thanks, Citadel, I seem to have glorious company!</td>', 'Originally posted by Citadel: In retrospect, something in the back of my mind told me that this was yours Irene. I don''t know anyone who has such skill in photographing liquids.   I too had the same feeling and sent a PM to Irene last week feeling a bit embarrassed about it since I am no photographer and so whether my instincts will be valued! Thanks, Citadel, I seem to have glorious company!', '2008-05-03 03:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4676579, 671202, 87278, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing what you can do with a drop of water! <br/>Congrats Irene on your blue ribbon! But I am making your outtake two  as my favorite!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-03 02:51:14.</i></td>', 'It''s amazing what you can do with a drop of water! Congrats Irene on your blue ribbon! But I am making your outtake two  as my favorite!', '2008-05-03 03:49:36.000000', '2008-05-03 03:51:14.000000', 0),
