(4676635, 670350, 62187, '<td valign="top">Wow Tareq - after reading the title of the photo and then looking at who took the photo - wow, I didn''t think you had it in you - it''s hilarious and very clever! The photo is excellent too - I''m surprised it didn''t place even higher.</td>', 'Wow Tareq - after reading the title of the photo and then looking at who took the photo - wow, I didn''t think you had it in you - it''s hilarious and very clever! The photo is excellent too - I''m surprised it didn''t place even higher.', '2008-05-03 04:48:51.000000', NULL, 0),
