(4678992, 670907, 66597, '<td valign="top">Terry, this is really beautiful. Congrats on the top 10, too! I love the background color choice. It very much compliments the shell.</td>', 'Terry, this is really beautiful. Congrats on the top 10, too! I love the background color choice. It very much compliments the shell.', '2008-05-04 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 0),
