(4682728, 671462, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looking at your profile, and at this, I''d have to say greens and yellows are your thing. (I seem to be into dull blues, grays and blacks lately -- what''s that say?) Anyway, great capture here and I do love the bright earthy colors.</td>', 'Looking at your profile, and at this, I''d have to say greens and yellows are your thing. (I seem to be into dull blues, grays and blacks lately -- what''s that say?) Anyway, great capture here and I do love the bright earthy colors.', '2008-05-05 20:55:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4684238, 671279, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooooh. . .I <i>like</i> this!  The pen has an antique, nostalgic look.  I love the scratches and signs of much use on it.  And the bold close-up topic makes this something that would look very nice framed and hanging on a wall!<br/> <br/>Very excellent!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ooooooh. . .I like this!  The pen has an antique, nostalgic look.  I love the scratches and signs of much use on it.  And the bold close-up topic makes this something that would look very nice framed and hanging on a wall! Very excellent! ', '2008-05-06 11:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4684263, 671462, 23098, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bvy:</b></div><hr/><i> Looking at your profile, and at this, I''d have to say greens and yellows are your thing. (I seem to be into dull blues, grays and blacks lately -- what''s that say?) Anyway, great capture here and I do love the bright earthy colors. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You are right about the colors. :)  Green actually is my favorite color but --  I''ve got to get out of my backyard more! ;)  The shots in blues and grays that I see in your profile tell me that you use those colors very well. keep up the good work!</td>', 'Originally posted by bvy: Looking at your profile, and at this, I''d have to say greens and yellows are your thing. (I seem to be into dull blues, grays and blacks lately -- what''s that say?) Anyway, great capture here and I do love the bright earthy colors.  You are right about the colors. :)  Green actually is my favorite color but --  I''ve got to get out of my backyard more! ;)  The shots in blues and grays that I see in your profile tell me that you use those colors very well. keep up the good work!', '2008-05-06 12:04:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4686128, 671207, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t score higher. For some reason, voters prefer the water drop reflections that show the reflected image/object in the background. I find those shots ruin the "trick" by showing the image/object in the background not to mention it doesn''t make the shot better by including it (rather the opposite). Anyway, good job here.</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t score higher. For some reason, voters prefer the water drop reflections that show the reflected image/object in the background. I find those shots ruin the "trick" by showing the image/object in the background not to mention it doesn''t make the shot better by including it (rather the opposite). Anyway, good job here.', '2008-05-07 04:01:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4686632, 671335, 34938, '<td valign="top">beautiful!</td>', 'beautiful!', '2008-05-07 10:01:12.000000', NULL, 0),
